      "audited_reference": "To ingest the test document 'test.pdf' into the system, you can use the following curl command: `curl -X POST \"http://localhost:8000/api/v1/ingest/document\" -H \"Content-Type: multipart/form-data\" -F \"file=@test.pdf\" -F 'metadata={\"author\":\"Test User\",\"category\":\"test\"}'`. After uploading, you can check the processing status with the command `curl http://localhost:8000/api/v1/ingest/task/abc123`, where 'abc123' is the task ID. The expected response will be a JSON object indicating the task ID, status, and a message, such as: `{ \"task_id\": \"abc123\", \"status\": \"PENDING\", \"message\": \"Document 'test.pdf' queued for processing\" }`.",
      "benchmark_id": "KGV1-014",
